# 공개 API 계약: README pre-commit 훅 사용 예 (기능 001 readme_examples_test_pre_commit_example, precommit_hook_test, SC-007)
# Git은 훅 실행 전 작업 디렉터리를 작업 트리 루트로 옮기므로 cwd를 프로젝트 루트로 둔다. 실제 커밋 중단은 tests/manual-checks.md에서 확인한다.
target readme-example pre-commit
layer api
self .git/hooks/pre-commit
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tool/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.sh
fs file /t/my\sproject/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
fs file /t/my\sproject/.git/hooks/pre-commit

case readme-pre-commit-passes-when-path-exists
fs file /t/my\sproject/config/app.json
cwd /t/my\sproject
status 0
out project-path-gateway: 검증 통과 1건
op source ./.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.sh

case readme-pre-commit-fails-when-path-missing
cwd /t/my\sproject
status 1
err project-path-gateway: 누락: APP_CONFIG=config/app.json
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
op source ./.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.sh
